grave concerns over the Malaysian Government's approval for a new rare earth refinery in Pahang, and the process by which it has been established; and (c) calls on Lynas to process the thorium ore on site at the Mount Weld mine to minimise the risk of damage arising from radioactive waste. Question put.","result":"negative","slug":"division-federal-senate-183","source_url":"https://theyvoteforyou.org.au/divisions/senate/2012-11-27/2"}
